sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Controller as Migration Controller
    participant Source as Source Node
    participant Target as Target Node
    participant Storage as Checkpoint Storage

    API->>Controller: Create MigratingPod CR
    Controller->>API: Update Status (Pending)
    Controller->>Source: Initiate Checkpoint
    Source->>Storage: Save Container State
    Source-->>Controller: Checkpoint Complete
    Controller->>Target: Prepare for Restore
    Storage->>Target: Transfer Checkpoint Data
    Target->>Target: Restore Container
    Target-->>Controller: Restore Complete
    Controller->>API: Update Status (Succeeded)
    Controller->>API: Update Service/DNS
